{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CghFN9mZCovwfxLBrtPUt","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Dev Mode now has real rows in every tab except Debug, which only has auto-play. Next are the deliverable texts: the About feedback pages need the real answers, and then the exit interview, README, PATCHES and CONTENT. I'll write the feedback pages first."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2346,"cache_read_input_tokens":599435,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2346},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c642ce04-34f8-46f2-be98-ceed51703e52","uuid":"c8f27606-976f-45bc-b115-960821f620fd","timestamp":"2026-11-04T04:22:08.890Z","request_id":"req_011CghFN9TxKA5NysTavLr4P"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CghFN9mZCovwfxLBrtPUt","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_019AQyH3L1Ecaeh4qmrw3ttM","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\nimport re\np='src/43-story.js'\ns=open(p).read()\nstart=s.index(\"    { title: 'TESTING FEEDBACK', lines: [\")\nend=s.index(\"    { title: 'CREDITS'\")\nnew=\"\"\"    { title: 'TESTING FEEDBACK', lines: ['Issues caught: about twenty defects in the sim, the bot and the view, found by the bot runs and the checks (estimate).', 'Critical: six, each of which stopped a run: combat damage that never reached the counters, a key that never reached the pack, a door the bot closed behind itself, a stand cell on the far side of a door, a hand emptied before a throw, and a stall while a monster stood near.', 'Most helpful: the floor-one bot trace that printed each goal change with the hand contents.', 'Least helpful: the browser smoke test, which only checks for errors and the first screens, not play.'] },\n    { title: 'ENGINE FEEDBACK', lines: ['Liked most: the 3D world API (a fixed camera, things, mobs as cards, the pen) and the 2D engine\\\\'s game.debug and input.tap / hold for tests.', 'Got stuck: the 3D things list has no plate or stair, so we drew them; the input presets merge with our own action names in ways the API card does not spell out.', 'Built ourselves: the sim, the bot, the wiring, the dungeon presenter and every screen.', 'Hardest: the input and menu details (custom action names, the pause menu items, settings), which are only sketched in the API card.', 'Changed in the engine: none.', 'Would change: ship the common things (plate, stair, a door variant) in the 3D library, and document the custom input map in one table.'] },\n    { title: 'PROMPT FEEDBACK', lines: ['Liked most: the exact maps, ids and tables, which made the content checkable.', 'Confusing: some numbers do not follow the plan\\\\'s own formulas (Durgan\\\\'s HP), \"silent\" teleporters are described two ways, and the plan asks for E.Grid where a small BFS was simpler.', 'Hardest: holding every system to its full depth in one session; the spec is larger than one session.', 'Would change: a cut list per milestone with what to drop first, and a separate acceptance list per floor.'] },\n\"\"\"\ns=s[:start]+new+s[end:]\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nprint('ok')\nEOF\ncat src/43-story.js > tests/out/s.mjs && node --check tests/out/s.mjs && rm -f tests/out/s.mjs && echo syntax-ok","description":"Write the real feedback answers into the About pages"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2346,"cache_read_input_tokens":599435,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2346},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c642ce04-34f8-46f2-be98-ceed51703e52","uuid":"e8277a65-ff0e-4fe9-ad86-d886671c385a","timestamp":"2026-11-04T04:22:12.944Z","request_id":"req_011CghFN9TxKA5NysTavLr4P","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_019AQyH3L1Ecaeh4qmrw3ttM":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-haiku-5-5-medium.build__20261103-202616__x53986f/work/EyeOfTheBoltHolder-EyeOfTheBeholder1991-claude-haiku-5-5-medium-20261103-202616 && python3 - <<'EOF'\nimport re\np='src/43-story.js'\ns=open(p).read()\nstart=s.index(\"    { title: 'TESTING FEEDBACK', lines: [\")\nend=s.index(\"    { title: 'CREDITS'\")\nnew=\"\"\"    { title: 'TESTING FEEDBACK', lines: ['Issues caught: about twenty defects in the sim, the bot and the view, found by the bot runs and the checks (estimate).', 'Critical: six, each of which stopped a run: combat damage that never reached the counters, a key that never reached the pack, a door the bot closed behind itself,