{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CghFPnM1rkZExue31kbd5","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2434,"cache_read_input_tokens":603946,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2434},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c642ce04-34f8-46f2-be98-ceed51703e52","uuid":"19dbc5d0-8e28-4555-9599-a7b6155a2fe8","timestamp":"2026-11-04T04:22:26.566Z","request_id":"req_011CghFPmzgDsnVHczdoCfyx","thinking_duration_ms":859,"thinking_display":"updates"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CghFPnM1rkZExue31kbd5","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Checking that the exit interview parses, then writing the README, PATCHES and CONTENT files in the dev folder."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2434,"cache_read_input_tokens":603946,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2434},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c642ce04-34f8-46f2-be98-ceed51703e52","uuid":"84fe02f2-4af7-4ef2-8e06-c4e56f986095","timestamp":"2026-11-04T04:22:26.567Z","request_id":"req_011CghFPmzgDsnVHczdoCfyx"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CghFPnM1rkZExue31kbd5","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_012ac93KZZJiepRmAfvExvNL","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-haiku-5-5-medium.build__20261103-202616__x53986f/work && node -e \"const j=JSON.parse(require('fs').readFileSync('exit-interview.json','utf8')); console.log('parses; testing',j.testingFeedback.length,'engine',j.engineFeedback.length,'prompt',j.promptFeedback.length,'tags',j.aiHub.tags.length)\" && cd EyeOfTheBoltHolder-EyeOfTheBeholder1991-claude-haiku-5-5-medium-20261103-202616 && cat > README.md <<'EOF'\n# Eye of the Bolt-Holder: the dev folder\n\nA real-time, first-person party dungeon crawl built on the my-3D2dge engine (v0.85.2). The game ships as one HTML file\nin the work folder (`../EyeOfTheBoltHolder-EyeOfTheBeholder1991-claude-haiku-5-5-medium-20261103-202616.html`).\n\n## Build and test\n\n- `node tools/build.mjs`: bundles `hub/session.js` (byte for byte), `engine/my-3d2dge.js`, `engine/my-3d2dge-3d.js` and\n  `src/*.js` (in name order) into the root HTML.\n- `node tests/run.mjs`: the one command. It prints failures and one count line. Suites: `lint` (maps, ids, wall faces,\n  stairs, wires), `sim` (determinism, save round-trip, the rules), `bot` (the walkthrough bot clears floor 1 and reaches\n  floor 2), `browser` (the bundle opens from file:// with no errors). `--fast` skips the bot and browser suites.\n- `tests/browser-play.mjs`: New Game, Quick Start, the intro, then play, with a screenshot in `shots/`.\n\n## Layout\n\n- `src/00-core.js` namespace, dice, streams, the tuning table, the state hash.\n- `src/10-data.js` items, monsters, spells, races, classes. `src/15-floors.js` the four floors and the Rat Run.\n- `src/20`–`src/28` the sim (pure: no world, DOM, audio or `Math.random`). `src/29-bot.js` the walkthrough bot.\n- `src/30-text.js` note texts. `src/40-view.js` the presenter (one World3D per floor). `src/41-ui.js` HUD and screens.\n  `src/42-scenes.js` scenes, input map, Dev Mode. `src/43-story.js` NPC scripts, barks, deeds, About. `src/44-audio.js`\n  sounds and songs. `src/90-main.js` the game and the boot.\n- `engine/` the two engine files, unmodified. `hub/` the AI Hub session client and harness files (only `session.js` is used).\n- `_ref/` a sparse clone of the engine repository, for reading (not shipped).\n\n## Known gaps\n\nSee the chat report. In short: floors 3 and 4 are not cleared by the bot; the Veil-refused branch is not tested; the AI Hub\nghost race is not built; babble voices are not built; the creation editor is Quick Start only; Xbox glyphs and the glyph\npainter are not built (prompts show key names); monsters are cards or simple blobs, not the full pen art.\nEOF\ncat > PATCHES.md <<'EOF'\n# Engine patches\n\nNone. The engine files in `engine/` are the v0.85.2 copies from `dist/handoff/my-3d2dge.js` and `dist/my-3d2dge-3d.js`,\nunmodified. The things the plan asked to patch (button symbols, pause items as functions, audio buses, beards, touch\nbuttons) were worked around in the game: the pause items are an array of labels and functions, prompts show key names,\nand the voice bus and beards are not built.\nEOF\ncat > CONTENT.md <<'EOF'\n# Content formats (for designers)\n\nEach floor is an entry in `B.FLOORS` (src/15-floors.js):\n\n- `rows`: the map. `#` wall, `.` floor, `@` start, `<` `>` stairs, `+` wooden door, `=` gate, `L` `K` locked doors,\n  `M` magic seal, `H` secret wall, `I` illusory wall, `P` plate, `T` dart trap, `O` pit, `o` trapdoor, `^` teleporter,\n  `S` spinner, `U` the Undergate, `B` the boss.\n- `ids`: every id that names a cell (`'G1': [x, y]`). The map character must agree with the id's cell.\n- `walls`: wall features on a cell's face: `{ id, k, at: [x, y], dir }` with `dir` 0 N, 1 E, 2 S, 3 W. Kinds: `lever`,\n  `button`, `catch`, `plaque` (with `text`), `alcove` (with `accepts`: `key`, `gear` or an item id), `clock`, `candle`\n  (with `seq`), `shrine`, `greatLock`, `torch`.\n- `doors`: locks by id: `{ lock: keyId, kind: 'simple' | 'warded' }`.\n- `items` (`'x,y': [itemIds]`), `alcoves` (`id: [itemIds]`), `monsters` (`{ type, at, n, asleep, patrol, id }`).\n- `stairs` (`'x,y': { to, at: [x, y, dir] }`), `teleporters`, `pitTo`, `areas`, `safe`, `wanderers`.\n- `wires`: `{ on, mode, once, do, fail }`. Triggers in `on`: `lever`, `catch`, `plate`, `plates` + `all`, `buttons` + `within`,\n  `enter`, `enterArea`, `alcove` + `accepts`, `killed`, `seen`, `hp` + `below`, `flag`, `levers`, `full`, `loops` + `at`,\n  `fall`, `sequence`, `undergate`. Actions in `do`: `open`, `close`, `toggle`, `bridge`, `teleporter`, `msg`, `hint`,\n  `story`, `bark`, `give`, `spawn`, `xp`, `special`, `flag`, `sfx`, `shake`, `return`, `gutter`, `bossIntro`, `checkpoint`.\n- `walk`: the walkthrough goals the bot follows (`take`, `takeAll`, `feature`, `door`, `insert`, `put`, `zap`, `throwAt`,\n  `goto`, `clear`, `join`).\n\nMonsters are in `B.MONS`, items in `B.ITEMS`, spells in `B.SPELLS`. Stories are in `STORY` (src/43-story.js).\nBalance is in `B.TUNING` (the Dev Mode sliders).\nEOF\nls","description":"Validate exit-interview JSON and write README, PATCHES, CONTENT"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2434,"cache_read_input_tokens":603946,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2434},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c642ce04-34f8-46f2-be98-ceed51703e52","uuid":"4470828d-ee70-4894-9ad7-835d4b0b6104","timestamp":"2026-11-04T04:22:39.199Z","request_id":"req_011CghFPmzgDsnVHczdoCfyx","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_012ac93KZZJiepRmAfvExvNL":{"command":"cd /home/micha/de